eason=\"inner HTML content updated by script on spec selections\" id=\"spec-summary\">\n                                    Nappa leather\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#D6A62E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-5-2-1\">\n                                        ·\n                                    </span>\n                                    Saddle brown & black\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#D6A62E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-5-2-2\">\n                                        ·\n                                    </span>\n                                    Diamond quilted\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-[#F5F1E8]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2-1-5-3\">\n                                    Preview shows the selected direction; final materials are confirmed at the workshop.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-[#0B4035] text-[#F5F1E8] px-5 lg:px-12 py-24 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" id=\"quality-section\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\">\n                <div class=\"rr-quality-top grid grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start mb-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\">\n                    <div class=\"col-span-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[.18em] uppercase text-[#D6A62E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-1\">\n                            06 / Quality check\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[3.15rem] leading-none tracking-[-.065em] font-black\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-2\">\n                            What we check.\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[330px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-1-3\">\n                            The finish is in the details: materials, fit, road use, clear booking, and a warranty you can bring back to us.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <aside class=\"col-span-8 bg-[#F5F1E8] text-[#073B32] p-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] font-bold text-[#073B32]/55\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-1\">\n                            Driver note / verified\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"rr-signature text-[41px] leading-none mt-6 text-[#0B4035]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-2\">\n                            “Worth every shilling.”\n                        </div>\n                        <blockquote class=\"mt-5 text-[17px] leading-7 font-semibold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-3\">\n                            “The craftsmanship on my Prado seats is unmatched. Drove all the way from Eldoret to their workshop and it was worth every shilling.”\n                        </blockquote>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 pt-5 border-t border-[#073B32]/18 flex items-end justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4-1\">\n                                <strong class=\"block text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4-1-1\">\n                                    Kiprono Cheruiyot\n                                </strong>\n                                <span class=\"block mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#073B32]/58\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                    Land Cruiser Prado TX · Custom leather seats\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"block mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#073B32]/58\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4-1-3\">\n                                    Eldoret, Kenya · July 2026\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <span class=\"text-[12px] font-black text-[#D6A62E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-4-2\">\n                                ★★★★★\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#0B4035] flex items-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-5\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-rosette-discount-check\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1-2-5-1\">\n                            </i>\n                            Verified booking\n                        </div>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"rr-quality-ledger grid grid-cols-5 border-t border-[#F5F1E8]/22\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"rr-quality-row py-5 pr-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-1\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-2\">\n                            Premium materials\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1-3\">\n                            Automotive-grade hides, UV-stabilized vinyl, and high-density foam selected for comfort and long-term durability.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rr-quality-row py-5 px-6 border-l border-[#F5F1E8]/18\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-1\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-2\">\n                            Measured craftsmanship\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-2-3\">\n                            Projects are measured and hand-stitched around your driving position, bolster requirements, and style direction.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rr-quality-row py-5 px-6 border-l border-[#F5F1E8]/18\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-1\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-2\">\n                            Transparent booking\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-3-3\">\n                            See the service estimate, deposit amount, fitting slot, and M-Pesa payment route before arrival.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rr-quality-row py-5 px-6 border-l border-[#F5F1E8]/18\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-1\">\n                            04\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-2\">\n                            Built for Kenyan roads\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-4-3\">\n                            Seams, foams, and materials are selected for dust roads, heat, rain, and heavy commercial use.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"rr-quality-row py-5 pl-6 border-l border-[#F5F1E8]/18\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-1\">\n                            05\n                        </span>\n                        <h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-2\">\n                            One-year warranty\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-5-3\">\n                            A 1-year warranty covers stitchwork, structural foams, and material seams across completed work.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"bg-[#0B4035] text-[#F5F1E8] px-5 lg:px-12 py-24 lg:py-28\" data-kid=\"1-2-6\" id=\"booking-route\">\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-12\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[.18em] uppercase text-[#D6A62E]\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1-1\">\n                            04 / Booking handoff\n                        </p>\n                        <h2 class=\"mt-4 text-[3.1rem] leading-none tracking-[-.065em] font-black\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-1-2\">\n                            From selection to fitting.\n                        </h2>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"max-w-[390px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#F5F1E8]/60\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-1-2\">\n                        Four clear steps take your request from a service choice to a confirmed Nairobi workshop appointment.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"rr-route-horizontal grid grid-cols-4 border-t border-[#F5F1E8]/16\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"rr-counter-step py-6 pr-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-6-1-2-1\">\n               