selected direction; final materials are confirmed at the workshop.\n                                        </p>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"col-span-5 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                <div class=\"border-t border-[#F5F1E8]/18 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-1\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#D6A62E] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-1\">\n                                            M01 / Material\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#F5F1E8]/45\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                            Choose one\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        <button class=\"rr-material is-active min-h-[64px] border border-[#D6A62E] text-left px-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-spec=\"Nappa leather\" data-spec-image=\"/api/local/images/public/images/upholstery/upholstery-02.jpg\" type=\"button\">\n                                            <span class=\"block text-[12px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                                Genuine Nappa Leather\n                                            </span>\n                                            <span class=\"block text-[10px] text-[#F5F1E8]/52 mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\">\n                                                Silky smooth / durable\n                        