cutive commuter.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"mt-7 text-[11px] font-black border-b-2 border-[#D6A62E] pb-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-3-2-4\" type=\"button\">\n                                    OPEN PROJECT FILE\n                                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ml-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-3-2-4-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"grid rr-portfolio-grid grid-cols-4 gap-7 mt-16\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4\">\n                            <figure data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-1\">\n                                <img alt=\"Land Cruiser Prado leather restyle\" class=\"w-full h-[235px] object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-1-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/public/images/upholstery/upholstery-10.jpg\"/>\n                                <figcaption class=\"rr-photo-caption mt-3 pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-1-2\">\n                                    <strong class=\"block text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-1-2-1\">\n                                        Land Cruiser Prado Luxury Restyle\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <span class=\"block mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#073B32]/58\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-1-2-2\">\n                                        Custom seats · Karen, Kenya\n                                    </span>\n                                </figcaption>\n                            </figure>\n                            <figure class=\"mt-8\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-2\">\n                                <img alt=\"Subaru WRX Alcantara steering stitch\" class=\"w-full h-[285px] object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4-1-4-2-1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/i