ing position, bolster requirements, and style direction.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"rr-quality-row grid grid-cols-[62px_220px_1fr] gap-5 py-5 items-start\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-3\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-3-1\">\n                                        03\n                                    </span>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                                        Transparent booking\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-3-3\">\n                                        See the service estimate, deposit amount, fitting slot, and M-Pesa payment route before arrival.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"rr-quality-row grid grid-cols-[62px_220px_1fr] gap-5 py-5 items-start\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[28px] text-[#D6A62E] font-black rr-tabular\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-4-1\">\n                                        04\n                                    </span>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-4-2\">\n                                        Built for Kenyan roads\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#F5F1E8]/62\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-5-1-2-1-4-3\">\n                                        Seams, foams, and materials are selected for dust roads, heat, rain, and heavy commercial use.\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\